oris-trace 1
# Bucket page lifecycle: bucket 31 (256-byte slots) holds 255 slots per page, so the
# 255th allocation fills the first page (page-full) and the 256th spawns a second page.
# Freeing a slot of the full page moves it back to the front (page-refill); purge then
# releases only the page that is entirely free.
